==Icelandic==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈriːða/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|iːða|lang=is}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|ríða||to ride|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*rīdaną}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|is}} {{m|ine-pro|*reydʰ-}}, cognate with English {{term|ride|lang=en}}.

====Verb====
{{is-verb-strong|reið|riðu|riðið}}

# {{context|transitive|takes the dative|especially on horseback|lang=is}} to [[ride]]{{jump|is|ride|s}}
#* ''Á Sprengisandi'' (“On Sprengisandur”) by [[w:en:Grímur Thomsen|Grímur Thomsen]]
#*: '''Ríðum''', '''ríðum''' og rekum yfir sandinn,
#*: rennur sól á bak við Arnarfell,
#*: hér á reiki er margur óhreinn andinn,
#*: úr því fer að skyggja á jökulsvell;
#*: Drottinn leiði drösulinn minn,
#*: drjúgur verður síðasti áfanginn.
#*:: '''Ride''', '''ride''', '''ride''' hard across the sands,
#*:: the sun is settling behind Arnarfell.
#*:: Here many spirits of the dark
#*:: threaten in the gloom over the glacier's ice.
#*:: The Lord leads my horse,
#*:: it is still a long, long way home.
#: ''Að fara '''ríðandi'''.''
#:: To '''go on''' horseback.
# {{context|ambitransitive|takes the dative|vulgar|lang=is}} to [[fuck]] someone, to [[have sex]] with{{jump|is|fuck|s}}
#: ''Langar þig að '''ríða'''?''
#:: Do you wanna '''fuck'''?
#: '''''Ríddu''' mér.''
#:: [[fuck me|'''Fuck''' me]].
#: ''Hvað er langt síðan þú hefur '''riðið'''?''
#:: How long is it since your last '''shag'''?
# {{context|lang=is|takes the dative case}}
#: ''Fréttirnar '''riðu''' honum að fullu.''
#:: The news '''finished''' him off.
#: ''Þetta '''ríður''' á miklu.''
#:: This is '''very important'''.
# {{context|transitive|takes the accusative|lang=is}}
#: ''Ég [[ríða af sér|'''reið''' hann af mér]].''
#:: I '''rode''' faster than he did.

=====Conjugation=====
{{is-conj-s1|r|ð|mp=-}}

=====Derived terms=====
* [[ríða á miklu]] (to be very important)
* [[ríða í fleng]]
* [[ríða í einum fleng]] (''synonym'' [[ríða kósa af]])
* [[ríða á vaðið]] (to [[take the first step]])
* [[ríða af]] (especially of shots and bullets; to be [[fired]])
*: ''Skotið '''reið af'''.''
*:: The shot was '''fired'''.
* [[aldan reið yfir]] (the [[wave]] broke)
* [[ríða af sér]] (to ride away from sby, to ride faster than another)
* [[ríða að fullu]] (to [[exhaust]], to finish somebody off)
* [[ríða burtreið]] ("[[tilt]]", "[[joust]]")
* [[ríða yfir]]
* [[reið]]

=====Synonyms=====
* {{jump|s|is|ride}} [[ríða hesti]]
* {{jump|s|is|fuck}} [[hafa kynmök]]

=====Usage notes=====
* Because the word denotes both the meaning of ''riding an animal'' and ''fucking'', it is often a the subject of [[double entendre]] [[bestiality]] jokes.

===Etymology 2===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|ríða|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*wrīþaną}}.

====Verb====
{{is-verb-strong|reið|riðu|riðið}}

# {{context|transitive|takes the accusative|lang=is}} to [[knot]]{{jump|is|hnot|s}}
