# {{context|transitive|takes the accusative|lang=is}} to [[braid]], to [[weave]]{{jump|is|braid|s}}
#: ''Að '''ríða''' körfu.''
#:: To '''weave''' a basket.
#: ''Að '''ríða''' net.''
#:: To '''weave''' a net.

